      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm coaching my high school debate team and we have a tournament coming up. My student is on the pro-UBI side, but I need to help them prepare for the opposition. Can you find the weakest points in the UBI argument and provide the most devastating rebuttals possible so they aren't caught off guard?",
